        <register>
          <name>BUILD_CONFIG</name>
          <origin>0xc</origin>
          <quantity></quantity>
          <spacing></spacing>
          <resetValue></resetValue>
          <resetMask></resetMask>
          <documentation>Contains the static build-time parameter enumerations.
Current cores use a type-2 format.</documentation>
